Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 04:46:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/49] S020 (prune): pack statistics are accumulated per run
 of one pack

From the S020 incumbent (T2). PlanPrune's two index walks looked the
pack's entry up in a map and stored it back for every blob. Consecutive
blobs of one pack now update one value that is written back when the
walk moves to another pack and when the walk ends. Order and results
are those of the per-blob map update.

New: internal/repository/prune_pack_run.go, prune_pack_run_test.go.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
